OL,3,GNEWSASchool cameras to cut 'abuse' from
OL,4,Adrivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAutomatic Number Plate Recognition
OL,7,F(ANPR) cameras could be introduced
OL,8,Foutside four Bristol primary schools to
OL,9,Fhelp enforce road closures during
OL,10,Fpick-up and drop-off.
OL,12,FThe School Streets scheme bans the
OL,13,Fdriving of cars outside schools at the
OL,14,Fbeginning and end of the day. It is
OL,15,Fimplemented by school staff, who
OL,16,FBristol City Council said have received
OL,17,Fabuse from motorists.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
