OL,3,GNEWSASchool cameras to cut 'abuse' from
OL,4,Adrivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Committee chairman Ed Plowden
OL,7,Fsaid: "Unfortunately on these four
OL,8,Fsites the schools have said that
OL,9,Fthey're really finding it difficult, so
OL,10,Fwe're trying to put in a bit of extra
OL,11,Fsupport to make sure that it works for
OL,12,Fthem."
OL,14,FA consultation is open until 20th
OL,15,FOctober.
